window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Rules.</b></p> <p>Some people say they are meant to be broken, but not these ones.</p> <p>These are designed to protect me, to make sure I never feel the pain I did almost ten years ago.</p> <p>The dull but present pain I still feel every time my past taunts me.</p> <p>From the loyalties that have remained broken, I built my walls high and tall, creating these rules to make sure all hearts, most of all mine, will stay guarded.</p> <p>That was the plan at least, until she came along.</p>"; 
